OL,3,GNEWSAWho is the newly independent
OL,4,Aunionist MP Carla Lockhart ?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarla Lockhart has resigned from the
OL,7,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP) over
OL,8,Fits handling of the fallout of a
OL,9,Fparading dispute.
OL,11,FThe MP is to sit as an independent
OL,12,Funionist in the House of Commons.
OL,14,FHer resignation was widely expected
OL,15,Fafter a clash with the DUP leadership
OL,16,Fover its failure to remove Sinn Fein's
OL,17,FMichelle O'Neill from her role as first
OL,18,Fminister.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
