OL,3,GNEWSAWho is the newly independent
OL,4,Aunionist MP Carla Lockhart ?
OL,5,
OL,6,FO'Neill and several other senior Sinn
OL,7,FFein figures have been interviewed by
OL,8,Fpolice for taking part in a protest
OL,9,Fwhich prevented an Orange Order parade
OL,10,Ffrom going down the mainly nationalist
OL,11,FGarvaghy Road in Portadown last month.
